### Test 07: Delete an existing especialidades
### Positive test

### Create a new especialidades, which we will delete
# @name createdespToDelete
POST {{BASE}}/especialidades
Content-Type: application/json
Token: {{token}}

{
	"nombre": ###REPLACE###,
	"descripcion": ###REPLACE###,
	"codigo": ###REPLACE###,
	"activa": ###REPLACE###,
	"fecha_creacion": ###REPLACE###
}

### Check the created especialidades
@espdelId = {{createdespToDelete.response.body.lastId}}
GET {{BASE}}/especialidades/{{espdelId}}
Content-Type: application/json 

### Delete the especialidades
DELETE {{BASE}}/especialidades/{{espdelId}}
Token: {{token}}

### Check the deleted especialidades
GET {{BASE}}/especialidades/{{espdelId}}
Content-Type: application/json 

